{
  "title": "Celeste’s Walk the Line Creation Takes the Stage",
  "body": "A closer look at **Celeste Thomson’s Walk the Line creation**, modelled by Chris.\n\nCeleste was selected as one of just **80 finalists from across New Zealand** for the Walk the Line NZ Fashion Week Student Competition.\n\nHer design brings together ideas from flora, marine life and space, using shades of blue and green throughout. Sustainability was also a key part of the design, with the garment made from recycled 100% cotton fabrics and natural dyes.\n\nThe piece includes hand and machine embroidery, appliqué, ruffles, smocking, detachable sleeves and handmade clay buttons. There is a lot of skill and careful work in every detail.\n\nCongratulations, Celeste, on this fantastic achievement and on representing **Rosehill College Fabric Technology** on the national stage.",
